Respond with JSON only:
{{
  "summary": "1-2 sentence explanation",
  "severity": <1-10>,
  "threat_type": "DDoS|Privilege Escalation|Data Exfiltration|Malware|Policy Violation|Reconnaissance|Unknown",
  "confidence": <0.0-1.0>,
