    GET  /api/llm/diagnostics       ‚Äì verbose per-provider health (no auth)
    GET  /api/llm/status            ‚Äì compact provider list (auth required)
    POST /api/circuit-breaker/reset ‚Äì manually reset breakers
    GET  /api/circuit-breaker/status ‚Äì breaker state summary
    GET  /api/rate-limiter/status   ‚Äì alert-level rate limiter stats
    POST /api/rate-limiter/reset    ‚Äì reset rate limiter counters
    GET  /api/llm-stats/export      ‚Äì per-engine latency, cost, token stats
